    /// <br>[`AV_ERR_TRY_AGAIN_LATER`](crate::averrors::OH_AVErrCode::AV_ERR_TRY_AGAIN_LATER): The operation fails because no available buffer is obtained within the
    /// timeout period.
    ///
    /// Available since API-level: 20
